flowchart LR
  P[选择学习项目] --> N[明确唯一 Next Step]
  N --> A[Today Agenda<br/>Up Next·Carryover]
  A --> C{选择记录方式}
  C -->|30 秒补记| Q[Quick Log]
  C -->|专注学习| T[Timer]
  C -->|按例程执行| R0[Practice Blocks<br/>Guided Routine]
  Q --> S[生成 Session]
  T --> S
  R0 --> S
  S --> E{是否留下学习证据}
  E -->|是| F[添加 Proof<br/>图片·录音·文件·链接]
  E -->|暂不| L[写入 Learning Trail]
  F --> L
  L --> R[Weekly / Stage Review<br/>Facts·Patterns·Decisions]
  R --> QF{需要 Qualifying Proof?}
  QF -->|是| QA[验收 Evidence Contract<br/>Proof Revision]
  QF -->|否| D[用户明确确认决定]
  QA --> D
  D -->|继续或更新 Next Step| N
  D -->|结构性调整| PR[Plan Revision Draft<br/>Revision Guard]
  PR --> N
  D -->|暂停·完成·放弃| P
